	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An interaction between a chemical entity and a phenotype or disease, where the presence of the chemical gives rise to or exacerbates the phenotype." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch> <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000993> .
