	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An interaction between a chemical entity and a biological process or pathway." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_001250> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
