	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The course a disease typically takes from its onset, progression in time, and eventual resolution or death of the affected individual" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031797> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/ClinicalEntity> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "clinical entity" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/NamedThing> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Any entity or process that exists in the clinical domain and outside the biological realm. Diseases are placed under biological entities" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/ClinicalFinding> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
