	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhenotypicFeature> , _:c14n265 , _:c14n421 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "this category is currently considered broad enough to tag clinical lab measurements and other biological attributes taken as 'clinical traits' with some statistical score, for example, a p value in genetic associations." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
