	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/ClinicalAttribute> , _:c14n53 , _:c14n69 , _:c14n90 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A clinical measurement is a special kind of attribute which results from a laboratory observation from a subject individual or sample. Measurements can be connected to their subject by the 'has attribute' slot." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0001444> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
