	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "These are targets about which virtually nothing is known. They do not have known drug or small molecule activities that satisfy the activity thresholds detailed below AND satisfy two or more of the following criteria: A PubMed text-mining score from Jensen Lab less than 5, greater than or equal TO 3 Gene RIFs, or less than or equal to 50 Antibodies available according to http://antibodypedia.com." .
