	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Set membership of a gene in a family of genes related by common evolutionary ancestry usually inferred by sequence comparisons. The genes in a given family generally share common sequence motifs which generally map onto shared gene product structure-function relationships." ;
