	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The pattern or 'mode' in which a particular genetic trait or disorder is passed from one generation to the next, e.g. autosomal dominant, autosomal recessive, etc." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENO_0000141> , <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000005> , <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C45827> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
