	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A stage of development or growth of an organism, including post-natal adult stages" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000105> ;
