	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pairwise molecular interaction" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PairwiseGeneToGeneInteraction> , _:c14n103 , _:c14n1167 , _:c14n1222 , _:c14n1308 , _:c14n138 , _:c14n1436 , _:c14n1438 , _:c14n1738 , _:c14n1837 , _:c14n19 , _:c14n227 , _:c14n533 , _:c14n574 , _:c14n918 , _:c14n963 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An interaction at the molecular level between two physical entities" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Patent> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "patent" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Publication> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a legal document granted by a patent issuing authority which confers upon the patenter the sole right to make, use and sell an invention for a set period of time." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000313> , <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/Patent> , <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000153> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PathognomonicityQuantifier> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pathognomonicity quantifier" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/SpecificityQuantifier> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relationship quantifier between a variant or symptom and a disease, which is high when the presence of the feature implies the existence of the disease" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PathologicalAnatomicalExposure> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pathological anatomical exposure" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Attribute> , <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/ExposureEvent> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An abnormal anatomical structure, when viewed as an exposure, representing an precondition, leading to or influencing an outcome, e.g. thrombosis leading to an ischemic disease outcome." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PathologicalAnatomicalOutcome> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pathological anatomical outcome" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Outcome> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An outcome resulting from an exposure event which is the manifestation of an abnormal anatomical structure." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PathologicalAnatomicalStructure> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pathological anatomical structure" ;
