	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An outcome resulting from an exposure event which is the manifestation of a pathological process." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
