	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "amino acid entity" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A polypeptide is a molecular entity characterized by availability in protein databases of amino-acid-based sequence representations of its precise primary structure; for convenience of representation, partial sequences of various kinds are included, even if they do not represent a physical molecule." ;
