	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relationship quantifier" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/RelationshipType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition> ;
