	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "This  is in Biolink to support HP ontology annotations which use \"onset\" (with terms from HP)  as an annotation on a disease to phenotypic feature association.  Please only use it for this purpose.  If the intent is to describe the onset of a disease in the context of a treatment,  use object_aspect_qualifier and object_direction_qualifier to capture \"delayed onset\" or \"exacerbated onset\" slot." ;
