	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/supporting_study_metadata> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A uri or curie pointing to information about the methodology used to generate data supporting an Association." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/supporting_study_method_type> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/SlotDefinition> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supporting study method type" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/linkml/Uriorcurie> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/supporting_study_metadata> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A type of method that was applied in a study used to generate the information used as evidence (e.g. a type of experimental assay, or statistical calculation, or computational analysis)." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/supporting_study_size> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> , <https://w3id.org/linkml/SlotDefinition> ;
