	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/linkml/String> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/node_property> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "This slot holds a string representation of a URL for an external resource about the node it is  present on. Unlike an 'xref' that is primarily represented by a CURIE, this slot is intended to hold a full  URL that can be used to directly access a resource. When linking to an external resource that cannot be  represented by a unique CURIE, this slot should be used.  However, when the intent is to link to the  default URI expansion of a CURIE related to the node it is present on, the xref slot should be used instead." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
